# Binghamton University's own release (discovere.binghamton.edu), its Newswise copy (21 September 2011) and the IPUMS
# blog (the article in Civil War History could not be opened: Project MUSE returned a challenge page); History.com
# (Zeller) for the Battlefield Trust's response; the Trust's battle and casualty pages; NARA (Emancipation Proclamation
# transcript and featured page, Black soldiers, 13th Amendment, Homestead, Morrill and Pacific Railway Acts, Freedmen's
